      "version": 2756,
      "versionNonce": 2085739640,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789969192688,
      "created": 1789882225410,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Self Ingest 新增更灵活入湖接口；\n2. Quick Insight 业务用户可快速探查、分析、验证；\n3. Version Control 便捷的版本变更、合并和回滚等控制；\n4. Permission & Audit 完备的权限控制和追踪审计。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Self Ingest 新增更灵活入湖接口；\n2. Quick Insight 业务用户可快速探查、分析、验证；\n3. Version Control 便捷的版本变更、合并和回滚等控制；\n4. Permission & Audit 完备的权限控制和追踪审计。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
