      "text": "通过 Legacy 方式提供 Data Products 给用户和应用。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "通过 Legacy 方式提供 Data Products 给用户和应用。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Zr0ZEvKpOCfqlrT8cZVuc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3060.465744363545,
      "y": 1606.3415202294261,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1136852459,
      "version": 2706,
      "versionNonce": 1517231736,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789969192688,
      "created": 1789882238564,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "构建统一的语义层和多元化的数据消费层\n1.  L1 服务暴露层：Semantic Layer API, MCP Server;\n2. L2 语义抽象层：指标/维度/实体/过程/关系/规则；\n3. Data OS（权限/治理操作系统），为API和MCP Server\n提供统一的管控，比如：统一身份认证、细粒度权限、审计与\n可观测记录、速率限制与成本控制。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "构建统一的语义层和多元化的数据消费层\n1.  L1 服务暴露层：Semantic Layer API, MCP Server;\n2. L2 语义抽象层：指标/维度/实体/过程/关系/规则；\n3. Data OS（权限/治理操作系统），为API和MCP Server\n提供统一的管控，比如：统一身份认证、细粒度权限、审计与\n可观测记录、速率限制与成本控制。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
