    {
      "id": "SImxV1EGpwWV-pwyEYfdK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4254.93536267178,
      "y": 2125.063885682061,
      "width": 465.29613715584986,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBe",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1145245448,
      "version": 3074,
      "versionNonce": 745716720,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790042279964,
      "created": 1789969232893,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DataR Uploader & 离线工具 上传管数据到 Redshift\n和 业务自留地等，不能满足 Data Contract定制，校\n验规则也比较繁琐，缺乏 Audit 审计能力。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DataR Uploader & 离线工具 上传管数据到 Redshift 和 业务自留地等，不能满足 Data Contract定制，校验规则也比较繁琐，缺乏 Audit 审计能力。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f2kddjk6M6mEQnWbLiejK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4787.392575185859,
      "y": 2125.063885682061,
      "width": 568.0603071834521,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1578888712,
      "version": 3384,
      "versionNonce": 50638832,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790041196560,
      "created": 1789969232893,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Flexible Ingestion 新增更灵活且便捷数据上传和入湖接口；\n2. Scalable Batch Ingestion 可伸缩的数据注入能力；\n3. Quick Insight 业务用户可快速探查、分析、验证；\n4. Version Control 便捷的版本变更、合并和回滚等控制；\n5. Permission & Audit 完备的权限控制和追踪审计。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Flexible Ingestion 新增更灵活且便捷数据上传和入湖接口；\n2. Scalable Batch Ingestion 可伸缩的数据注入能力；\n3. Quick Insight 业务用户可快速探查、分析、验证；\n4. Version Control 便捷的版本变更、合并和回滚等控制；\n5. Permission & Audit 完备的权限控制和追踪审计。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
