      "created": 1789969232894,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "让业务数据资产入湖流程更加灵活可控，同时能获取快速\n探查和校验、还可自动定制 Data Contract 以及对数据版\n本控制等。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "让业务数据资产入湖流程更加灵活可控，同时能获取快速\n探查和校验、还可自动定制 Data Contract 以及对数据版\n本控制等。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wJysM9gAEOiumZE8HE7v0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5190.77352727648,
      "y": 1817.275574677925,
      "width": 710.171215983159,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
