      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790056557989,
      "created": 1790056277889,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Governance by design — 分层治理机制而非口号：governance_tier标签 + 按entity type差异化校验规则（隐私合规型 vs 合同财务型）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Governance by design — 分层治理机制而非口号：governance_tier标签 + 按entity type差异化校验规则（隐私合规型 vs 合同财务型）",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UBMtysmFEYRuSlzxBM5Jo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6474.2556437044295,
      "y": 2450.5643860239284,
      "width": 1118.9474364501034,
