      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790056557989,
      "created": 1790056277891,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Semantic understanding for AI — 字段语义映射、实体关系模型、同义词对照，必须锚定在已标准化的宽表/主题表之上",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Semantic understanding for AI — 字段语义映射、实体关系模型、同义词对照，必须锚定在已标准化的宽表/主题表之上",
      "autoResize": false,
