      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6. Permission inheritance — AI/查询门户结果须严格继承现有权限体系，脱离eDc等于维护两套权限、迟早越权泄露",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
